---
import Icon from '../Icon.astro';
import {agency} from '../../data/agency';
---
<section class="u-pricing u-editorial-section" id="pricing" data-window="Pricing / Three starting points"><div class="u-section-top"><span>INVESTMENT / THREE STARTING POINTS</span><span>THE SCOPE BEGINS WITH YOUR BRIEF</span></div><h2>A clear choice.<br/><span>A considered scope.</span></h2><p class="u-section-lede">Choose a starting point for your website. The final deliverables are confirmed around your brief.</p><div class="u-price-grid">{agency.pricing.map(plan=><article class="u-price-card"><div class="u-card-title"><span>{plan.name.toLowerCase()}.txt</span><span aria-hidden="true"><Icon name="maximize"/></span></div><span class="u-meta">WD / {plan.number}</span><h3>{plan.name}</h3><strong class="u-price">{plan.price}</strong><p>{plan.description}</p><ul>{plan.features.map(feature=><li>{feature}</li>)}</ul><a class="u-action" href={`/weird-internet/start/?plan=${plan.id}`}>{plan.label}</a></article>)}</div></section>
